# Screenshots Directory

Save all test screenshots here during live payment test:

1. `01-account-creation.png` - Signup confirmation
2. `02-payment-success.png` - Payment success page
3. `03-stripe-payment.png` - Stripe Dashboard payment details
4. `04-webhook-success.png` - Stripe webhook delivery success
5. `05-database-upgrade.png` - Terminal showing tier upgrade
6. `06-pro-features.png` - Dashboard with Pro features active
7. `07-refund-success.png` - Stripe Dashboard refund confirmation
8. `08-downgrade.png` - Terminal showing tier downgrade
9. `09-free-tier-ui.png` - Dashboard after downgrade to free

**Tip**: Use ⌘+Shift+4 (Mac) or Windows+Shift+S (Windows) for screenshots.
